  "notes": "USAGE:\nOften used in social welfare, education, and community contexts to describe the act of proactively reaching out to someone. Carries a nuance of warmth and initiative. The verb form {声|こえ}かけする is also common.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {声|こえ}かけをする: to call out to, to reach out to\n- {声|こえ}かけ{運動|うんどう}: outreach campaign\n- {声|こえ}かけ{活動|かつどう}: outreach activities\n- {積極的|せっきょくてき}な{声|こえ}かけ: proactive outreach",
